    <briefdescription>
<para>The TLM2 transaction recorder. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This module records all TLM transaction to a SCV transaction stream for further viewing and analysis. The handle of the created transaction is storee in an tlm_extension so that another instance of the scv_tlm2_recorder e.g. further down the opath can link to it. The transaction recorder is simply bound between an existing pair of initiator and target sockets </para>
    </detaileddescription>
